{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004270/extras/b18c8c34be0adb034980f9cfe7ff81a0.avif?t=1758691839\" width=1242 height=1844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange events occurred on Happy Island. Animals and plants turned evil one after another, and the evil attacked the humans on Happy Island.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brave and peace-loving young warrior is about to confront a mysterious event taking place on Happy Island.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Youth warriors will restore peace and joy to Happy Island through exploration and battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore Happy Island comprehensively\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into areas such as the coast, mountains, and snow-capped peaks\uff0cTest the splendid jumping moves and shooting skills of the young warriors and eliminate all kinds of enemies that have lost control\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game attack\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals on the ground can jump and trample to attack\uff0cPlants, water and flying animals can only be attacked by weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Increased health points\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate monsters such as animals and plants that appear under the control of evil magic, Eat the gold coins to earn high scores. Once you get a certain number of points, you will be rewarded with 1 health point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Acceptable animals\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game requires players to knock out the cute animals they want to save by jumping,Shooting is also a way to stun and save vulnerable animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game world\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is necessary to test the player's precise and quick key-pressing response, Perform healthy exercises that synchronize your brain and fingers in the face of the suddenly appearing cute animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004270?t=1758691839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004270/c1e33dfa518eec60d0a4cc050a09f9f621cc36fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758691839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004270/002b6a9f26519dd79990d110fae6c8cc75d38ec3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758691839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004270/002b6a9f26519dd79990d110fae6c8cc75d38ec3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758691839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004270/extras/b18c8c34be0adb034980f9cfe7ff81a0.avif?t=1758691839\" width=1242 height=1844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange events occurred on Happy Island. Animals and plants turned evil one after another, and the evil attacked the humans on Happy Island.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brave and peace-loving young warrior is about to confront a mysterious event taking place on Happy Island.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Youth warriors will restore peace and joy to Happy Island through exploration and battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore Happy Island comprehensively\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into areas such as the coast, mountains, and snow-capped peaks\uff0cTest the splendid jumping moves and shooting skills of the young warriors and eliminate all kinds of enemies that have lost control\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game attack\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals on the ground can jump and trample to attack\uff0cPlants, water and flying animals can only be attacked by weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Increased health points\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate monsters such as animals and plants that appear under the control of evil magic, Eat the gold coins to earn high scores. Once you get a certain number of points, you will be rewarded with 1 health point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Acceptable animals\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game requires players to knock out the cute animals they want to save by jumping,Shooting is also a way to stun and save vulnerable animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game world\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is necessary to test the player's precise and quick key-pressing response, Perform healthy exercises that synchronize your brain and fingers in the face of the suddenly appearing cute animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ZuoYuanYouYang  Co.,Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004270/c7032a0d63bd07160862d69d11bd004325b32674/header.jpg?t=1758691839","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"( C ) (\u5de6\u9e33\u53f3\u9e2f)ZuoYuanYouYang 2025 ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192102,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192102/movie480.mp4?t=1758085510","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192102/movie_max.mp4?t=1758085510"},"name":"\u5e7b\u60f3\u9752\u6625\u4f20 Fantasy Youth \u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u30bf\u30b8\u30fc\u9752\u6625","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192102/a8821785a20b75836a706f1b8b98887